# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECURITY — READ BEFORE COMMITTING
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. The following must NEVER appear in any committed
# file, comment, commit message, or branch name:
#
#   • Internal domain names or hostnames
#   • Internal IP addresses (LAN, RFC1918, or otherwise)
#   • Docker container names specific to your deployment
#   • PUID / PGID values
#   • Usernames, passwords, tokens, or API keys
#   • File system paths that reveal machine layout
#   • Any value that identifies your network or infrastructure
#
# All environment-specific values belong in .env — which is gitignored below.
# Use .env.example (with placeholder values only) for documentation.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Environment — all real values live here, never in version control
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/

# Entrypoint runtime cache
.cache/
*.lock_hash

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor artifacts
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Local deployment files: real paths, IPs and keys stay on your machine
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.override.yml
compose.yml
compose.override.yml
*.asc
